│ An example of this method is its application to the use of intravenous streptokinase as thrombolytic therapy for     │
│ acute infarction. Thirty-three trials evaluating this therapy were performed between 1959 and 1988. We found that a  │
│ consistent, statistically significant reduction in total mortality (odds ratio, 0.74; 95 percent confidence          │
